{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04736","headline":"奉和圣制寒食作应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制寒食作应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒食春过半，花穠鸟复娇。\n从来禁火日，会接清明朝。\n鬬敌鸡殊胜，争球马绝调。\n晴空数云点，香树百风摇。\n改木迎新燧，封田表旧烧。\n皇情爱嘉节，传曲与箫韶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}